ellow, \"Confirmed\" badge in green, \"Cancelled\" badge in red, \"Completed\" badge in blue.\n664-\n665:#### Test: Trip card shows property image or placeholder\n666-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. One booking has a property with images, another has a property with no images.\n667-- **Expected:** The trip card for the property with images shows the main property image. The trip card for the property without images shows a placeholder image.\n668-\n669-#### Test: Clicking trip card navigates to booking details\n670-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. A trip card is displayed for a booking with id \"booking-123\".\n--\n702-\n703-#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on pending, confirmed, or cancelled bookings\n704-- **Initial state:** User is logged in. Bookings exist with statuses \"pending\", \"confirmed\", and \"cancelled\".\n705-- **Expected:** None of these trip cards display a \"Write Review\" button. The button only appears for \"completed\" bookings.\n706-\n707:#### Test: Trip cards are ordered by check-in date\n708-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the \"Upcoming\" tab. Multiple upcoming bookings exist with different check-in dates.\n709:- **Expected:** Trip cards are displayed in chronological order by check-in date, with the soonest upcoming trip first.\n710-\n711-### Component: CancelBookingDialog\n712-\n713-#### Test: Clicking Cancel button opens confirmation dialog\n714-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the \"Upcoming\" tab. A booking with status \"confirmed\" is displayed with a \"Cancel\" button."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1299eb81-ffa0-4f51-a2fd-69fb26f0839e","uuid":"87cf469d-b825-4ffc-ad2c-fb7d595a6252","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"597-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has bio set to null.\n598-- **Expected:** The host info card displays the host name, ava