[2026-03-15T00:02:09.896Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JhDudSAuqq7HZTgfqWdxVf","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now let me create a comprehensive summary document with all the findings:\n\n## Comprehensive Search Results: Trip-Related Components and Pages\n\nI've completed a thorough search of the Airbnb Clone codebase. Here's a detailed breakdown of all trip-related components, pages, and APIs:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **Trip Card Component & Test IDs**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx`\n\n**Test IDs Used:**\n- `trip-card-${booking.id}` - Main trip card container\n- `status-badge-${booking.id}` - Status badge (Pending/Confirmed/Cancelled/Completed)\n- `cancel-button-${booking.id}` - Cancel button (appears on pending/confirmed bookings)\n- `review-button-${booking.id}` - Write Review button (appears on completed bookings without review)\n- `reviewed-badge-${booking.id}` - Reviewed badge (appears on completed bookings with review)\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Displays property image, title, location (city/country), date range, and price\n- Status badge with color coding: pending (yellow), confirmed (green), cancelled (red), completed (blue)\n- Cancel button only appears on pending or confirmed bookings\n- Review button appears on completed bookings without a review\n- Clicking the card navigates to `/properties/${property_id}`\n\n**Data Structure (Booking Type):**\n```typescript\ninterface Booking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string (ISO format)\n  check_out: string (ISO format)\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string\n  property_city?: string\n  property_country?: string\n  property_image?: string | null\n  has_review?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. **My Trips Page**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n\n**Features:**\n- Requires authentication (redirects to `/login` if not logged in)\n- Test ID: `my-trips-page`\n- Fetches user bookings on mount via `fetchUserBookings(currentUser.id)`\n- Displays loading state\n- Renders `TripsTabs` component\n- Handles booking cancellation with `CancelBookingDialog`\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Trips Tabs Component**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n\n**Test IDs:**\n- `trips-tabs` - Main tabs container\n- `tab-upcoming` - Upcoming tab button\n- `tab-past` - Past tab button\n- `tab-cancelled` - Cancelled tab button\n- `trips-list` - List container\n- `trips-empty-state` - Empty state message\n\n**Tab Filtering Logic:**\n- **Upcoming:** pending or confirmed bookings with check_in >= today (sorted by check_in ASC)\n- **Past:** completed bookings (sorted by check_in ASC)\n- **Cancelled:** cancelled bookings (sorted by check_in ASC)\n\n**Empty State Messages:**\n- Upcoming: \"No upcoming trips\" with \"Browse properties\" link\n- Past: \"No past trips\"\n- Cancelled: \"No cancelled trips.\"\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Cancel Booking Dialog**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx`\n\n**Test IDs:**\n- `cancel-dialog-overlay` - Overlay that closes on click\n- `cancel-dialog` - Dialog container\n- `cancel-dialog-dismiss` - \"Keep Booking\" button\n- `cancel-dialog-confirm` - \"Yes, Cancel\" button\n\n**Features:**\n- Shows property title and formatted date range (long month format: \"May 10, 2026 – May 13, 2026\")\n- Modal overlay (can close by clicking outside)\n- Two action buttons: dismiss and confirm\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Bookings API (Netlify Function)**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`\n\n**GET Endpoint:** `/api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}`\n- **Returns:** Array of bookings with enriched property data\n- **Query:** Joins bookings with properties to include:\n  - `property_title`\n  - `property_city`\n  - `property_country`\n  - `property_image` (first image by display_order)\n  - `has_review` (boolean, checks if review exists)\n- **Sorting:** By check_in ASC\n\n**PUT Endpoint:** `/api/bookings/{bookingId}`\n- **Body:** `{ status: 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' }`\n- **Returns:** Updated booking\n\n**POST Endpoint:** `/api/bookings` (for creating new bookings)\n- **Body:** property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price, special_requests\n- **Creates:** New booking with 'pending' status\n\n**DELETE Endpoint:** `/api/bookings/{bookingId}`\n- **Deletes:** Single booking\n\n**Seed Data Management:**\n- DELETE `/api/bookings` (without ID) resets all non-seed bookings and restores seed data to original statuses\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Redux Bookings Slice**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts`\n\n**Async Thunks:**\n- `fetchUserBookings(guestId)` - GET `/api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}`\n- `createBooking(data)` - POST `/api/bookings`\n- `cancelBooking(bookingId)` - PUT `/api/bookings/{bookingId}` with `{ status: 'cancelled' }`\n\n**State Shape:**\n```typescript\n{\n  items: Booking[]\n  loading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. **Test Files**\n**Test Files Found:**\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cards.spec.ts` - TripCard component tests\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-tabs.spec.ts` - TripsTabs and tab filtering tests\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cancel-dialog.spec.ts` - CancelBookingDialog tests\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-review-order.spec.ts` - Review-related tests\n\n**Key Test Data (Seed Bookings):**\n- Emma's bookings: e1111111 (completed), e3333333 (pending), e6666666 (confirmed)\n- Alex's bookings: e2222222 (confirmed), e4444444 (completed), e5555555 (cancelled)\n- Emma's additional: e7777777 (confirmed)\n\n---\n\n### Summary Table: Component Hierarchy\n\n| Component | Location | Parent | Test IDs |\n|-----------|----------|--------|----------|\n| MyTrips | Page | - | `my-trips-page` |\n| TripsTabs | Component | MyTrips | `trips-tabs`, `tab-*`, `trips-list` |\n| TripCard | Component | TripsTabs | `trip-card-*`, `status-badge-*`, `cancel-button-*`, `review-button-*` |\n| CancelBookingDialog | Component | MyTrips | `cancel-dialog-*` |\n\nAll files are production-ready and comprehensively tested with Playwright."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aff8a1700675f5456 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 42132\ntool_uses: 17\nduration_ms: 25659</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1299eb81-ffa0-4f51-a2fd-69fb26f0839e","uuid":"6f9706cf-7ac9-4752-8c6b-eabb3c09d68c","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/AirbnbClone, find all components and pages related to \"trips\" and \"TripCard\". I need to understand:\n1. How trip cards are rendered (what test IDs they use)\n2. How the trips page works \n3. What the booking API returns\n\nSearch for:\n- Files containing \"trip-card\" or \"TripCard\" \n- Files containing \"my-trips\" \n- The trips page component\n- Any netlify function for bookings/trips\n\nBe thorough - check src/ directory, components, pages, and netlify/functions/","agentId":"aff8a1700675f5456","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now let me create a comprehensive summary document with all the findings:\n\n## Comprehensive Search Results: Trip-Related Components and Pages\n\nI've completed a thorough search of the Airbnb Clone codebase. Here's a detailed breakdown of all trip-related components, pages, and APIs:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **Trip Card Component & Test IDs**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx`\n\n**Test IDs Used:**\n- `trip-card-${booking.id}` - Main trip card container\n- `status-badge-${booking.id}` - Status badge (Pending/Confirmed/Cancelled/Completed)\n- `cancel-button-${booking.id}` - Cancel button (appears on pending/confirmed bookings)\n- `review-button-${booking.id}` - Write Review button (appears on completed bookings without review)\n- `reviewed-badge-${booking.id}` - Reviewed badge (appears on completed bookings with review)\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Displays property image, title, location (city/country), date range, and price\n- Status badge with color coding: pending (yellow), confirmed (green), cancelled (red), completed (blue)\n- Cancel button only appears on pending or confirmed bookings\n- Review button appears on completed bookings without a review\n- Clicking the card navigates to `/properties/${property_id}`\n\n**Data Structure (Booking Type):**\n```typescript\ninterface Booking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string (ISO format)\n  check_out: string (ISO format)\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string\n  property_city?: string\n  property_country?: string\n  property_image?: string | null\n  has_review?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. **My Trips Page**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n\n**Features:**\n- Requires authentication (redirects to `/login` if not logged in)\n- Test ID: `my-trips-page`\n- Fetches user bookings on mount via `fetchUserBookings(currentUser.id)`\n- Displays loading state\n- Renders `TripsTabs` component\n- Handles booking cancellation with `CancelBookingDialog`\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Trips Tabs Component**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n\n**Test IDs:**\n- `trips-tabs` - Main tabs container\n- `tab-upcoming` - Upcoming tab button\n- `tab-past` - Past tab button\n- `tab-cancelled` - Cancelled tab button\n- `trips-list` - List container\n- `trips-empty-state` - Empty state message\n\n**Tab Filtering Logic:**\n- **Upcoming:** pending or confirmed bookings with check_in >= today (sorted by check_in ASC)\n- **Past:** completed bookings (sorted by check_in ASC)\n- **Cancelled:** cancelled bookings (sorted by check_in ASC)\n\n**Empty State Messages:**\n- Upcoming: \"No upcoming trips\" with \"Browse properties\" link\n- Past: \"No past trips\"\n- Cancelled: \"No cancelled trips.\"\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Cancel Booking Dialog**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx`\n\n**Test IDs:**\n- `cancel-dialog-overlay` - Overlay that closes on click\n- `cancel-dialog` - Dialog container\n- `cancel-dialog-dismiss` - \"Keep Booking\" button\n- `cancel-dialog-confirm` - \"Yes, Cancel\" button\n\n**Features:**\n- Shows property title and formatted date range (long month format: \"May 10, 2026 – May 13, 2026\")\n- Modal overlay (can close by clicking outside)\n- Two action buttons: dismiss and confirm\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Bookings API (Netlify Function)**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`\n\n**GET Endpoint:** `/api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}`\n- **Returns:** Array of bookings with enriched property data\n- **Query:** Joins bookings with properties to include:\n  - `property_title`\n  - `property_city`\n  - `property_country`\n  - `property_image` (first image by display_order)\n  - `has_review` (boolean, checks if review exists)\n- **Sorting:** By check_in ASC\n\n**PUT Endpoint:** `/api/bookings/{bookingId}`\n- **Body:** `{ status: 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' }`\n- **Returns:** Updated booking\n\n**POST Endpoint:** `/api/bookings` (for creating new bookings)\n- **Body:** property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price, special_requests\n- **Creates:** New booking with 'pending' status\n\n**DELETE Endpoint:** `/api/bookings/{bookingId}`\n- **Deletes:** Single booking\n\n**Seed Data Management:**\n- DELETE `/api/bookings` (without ID) resets all non-seed bookings and restores seed data to original statuses\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Redux Bookings Slice**\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts`\n\n**Async Thunks:**\n- `fetchUserBookings(guestId)` - GET `/api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}`\n- `createBooking(data)` - POST `/api/bookings`\n- `cancelBooking(bookingId)` - PUT `/api/bookings/{bookingId}` with `{ status: 'cancelled' }`\n\n**State Shape:**\n```typescript\n{\n  items: Booking[]\n  loading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. **Test Files**\n**Test Files Found:**\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cards.spec.ts` - TripCard component tests\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-tabs.spec.ts` - TripsTabs and tab filtering tests\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cancel-dialog.spec.ts` - CancelBookingDialog tests\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-review-order.spec.ts` - Review-related tests\n\n**Key Test Data (Seed Bookings):**\n- Emma's bookings: e1111111 (completed), e3333333 (pending), e6666666 (confirmed)\n- Alex's bookings: e2222222 (confirmed), e4444444 (completed), e5555555 (cancelled)\n- Emma's additional: e7777777 (confirmed)\n\n---\n\n### Summary Table: Component Hierarchy\n\n| Component | Location | Parent | Test IDs |\n|-----------|----------|--------|----------|\n| MyTrips | Page | - | `my-trips-page` |\n| TripsTabs | Component | MyTrips | `trips-tabs`, `tab-*`, `trips-list` |\n| TripCard | Component | TripsTabs | `trip-card-*`, `status-badge-*`, `cancel-button-*`, `review-button-*` |\n| CancelBookingDialog | Component | MyTrips | `cancel-dialog-*` |\n\nAll files are production-ready and comprehensively tested with Playwright."}],"totalDurationMs":25659,"totalTokens":42132,"totalToolUseCount":17,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1035,"cache_read_input_tokens":39202,"output_tokens":1892,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1035},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
